ncy and confidence in clinical settings.\n\nVS-Management has been reviewed by medical experts and developed in accordance with the latest medical education standards, ensuring a reliable and effective learning environment. \n\nThis VR simulator offers an immersive experience for mastering ventilator procedures and alarm management.", "short_description": "VS-Management is a VR-based ventilator simulator designed for users to train ventilator operation and learn three key alarm management procedures."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "015.VS_M_Back.png", "id": "1690717328178195", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394271_1690717331511528_6387639417886293840_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RpOhNWyaiIMQ7kNvwG8-tQE&_nc_oc=AdouZvpQCk-83NIClW0ldqjI9e4hqPUIH-ZQ2zPac_lr055sboUd-5wvFXexLSCp5EM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJK9qiuu6hpY8-IWBh1Wz6NDhQGVksR-nQImq0Ir5Q5aQ&oe=6A9EBCB9"}, {"file_name": "014.VS_M.png", "id": "1624805861475462", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394167_1624805864808795_4742067852837435819_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5b4Aw4YmF4EQ7kNvwEKxuRP&_nc_oc=Adq5t1G8WuuNa_h_amPj9i6d7UVViGyH6qmNpOr4qIGxDNU7z0FVo-MsRJad4ZB-Ohc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJb9R074BlkG8V2F3lk2wT6LJ0MADXAsa84z_5eYOeGCg&oe=6A9EAB0F"}, {"file_name": "006.VS_M_Portrait.png", "id": "1192361138888724", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473400716_1192361142222057_7581507312873433284_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=n3zT2MQfQZYQ7kNvwFVEoAH&_nc_oc=AdrE6L6IaMPoltqbCbL7u_7R-k5-iMfFheiUQ-JMAGn2p8W4P39-HsshUADtR-Kc75c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLQWFB8UrbMvYKLoTtDhgRr6WDLVkTyWplM6Ek-yziUSg&oe=6A9EB8EE"}, {"file_name": "005.VS_M_Squar